{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "version": "1.0",
  "strings": {
    "正在听电脑的声音…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listening to this Mac's audio…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在听电脑的声音…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有找到可以采集声音的显示器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No display is available to capture audio from."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有找到可以采集声音的显示器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "字幕要用「屏幕与系统音频录制」权限才能听电脑的声音。请在系统设置中打开 Wisp，再开字幕。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captions need the Screen & System Audio Recording permission to hear what this Mac plays. Turn Wisp on in System Settings, then start captions again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字幕要用「屏幕与系统音频录制」权限才能听电脑的声音。请在系统设置中打开 Wisp，再开字幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开系统设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开系统设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「带上对方说的话」取字幕里对方最近几秒的话一起发，用来回答会议里刚被问到的问题。这类问答放在一个不保存的对话里，关掉字幕就清空。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Attach their words” sends the other side's last few seconds of captions with the question, to answer what you were just asked in a meeting. These questions and answers live in a conversation that is not saved and is cleared when captions turn off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「带上对方说的话」取字幕里对方最近几秒的话一起发，用来回答会议里刚被问到的问题。这类问答放在一个不保存的对话里，关掉字幕就清空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「按住说话提问」：按住快捷键说出问题，松开后按当前回答模式发送。麦克风录音不会保存，发出的转写文字会按当前对话的规则保留。按一下就松开不会发送。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold the shortcut to ask a question, then release to send it in the current response mode. Wisp discards the microphone recording. The active conversation determines whether the sent text is saved. A quick tap sends nothing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「按住说话提问」：按住快捷键说出问题，松开后按当前回答模式发送。麦克风录音不会保存，发出的转写文字会按当前对话的规则保留。按一下就松开不会发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「自动回答」：对方说完一句以问号结尾的话、停顿 1 秒后，自动执行第一条带字幕的指令（默认「快问」）。两次之间至少隔 8 秒。每次会向模型发一次请求，输入框里的草稿会保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto-answer runs the first caption command (Quick Ask by default) when the other side ends a sentence with a question mark and pauses for 1 second. Each answer sends one request to the model, at least 8 seconds apart. Your draft stays in the input box."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「自动回答」：对方说完一句以问号结尾的话、停顿 1 秒后，自动执行第一条带字幕的指令（默认「快问」）。两次之间至少隔 8 秒。每次会向模型发一次请求，输入框里的草稿会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「走 API 连接」：带上对方说的话的提问（在「指令」里设置）用「模型」页里配置的 API，不管面板当前用哪种连接。Agent CLI 每问一次都要启动一个进程，API 通常更快出第一个字。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask through the API: questions that attach the other side's words (set in Commands) use the API configured on the Model page, whichever connection the panel uses. An Agent CLI starts a process for every question; the API usually shows the first words sooner."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「走 API 连接」：带上对方说的话的提问（在「指令」里设置）用「模型」页里配置的 API，不管面板当前用哪种连接。Agent CLI 每问一次都要启动一个进程，API 通常更快出第一个字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 设备端（免费，音频不出电脑）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple on-device (free; audio stays on this Mac)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 设备端（免费，音频不出电脑）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 设备端识别免费，音频不离开这台 Mac，一次只认所选的那一种语言。Soniox 云端识别能同时认所选语言和英文，对中英混说、英文术语通常更准，按用量计费（约每小时 0.12 美元），字幕开着时电脑放出来的声音会发送到 Soniox。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple on-device recognition is free, the audio never leaves this Mac, and it recognizes only the one language you choose. Soniox cloud recognition handles the chosen language and English at the same time and is usually more accurate with mixed Chinese and English and with English terms. It is billed by use (about US$0.12 per hour), and while captions are on, what this Mac plays is sent to Soniox."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 设备端识别免费，音频不离开这台 Mac，一次只认所选的那一种语言。Soniox 云端识别能同时认所选语言和英文，对中英混说、英文术语通常更准，按用量计费（约每小时 0.12 美元），字幕开着时电脑放出来的声音会发送到 Soniox。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Base URL": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Base URL"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
