    },
    "只发截图和网址。不读页面，最快。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends the screenshot and URL only. Fastest."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只发截图和网址。不读页面，最快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "读取页面正文。动态页面可能只包含当前可见内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads page text. Dynamic pages may include visible content only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取页面正文。动态页面可能只包含当前可见内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机运行、无需联网；请选择支持图片输入的模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs locally with no network; choose a model that accepts images."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机运行、无需联网；请选择支持图片输入的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动桌面小药丸可调整它的位置。助手面板有自己的位置，重新打开时会尝试回到上次所在屏幕。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag the desktop island to move it. The assistant panel has its own position and reopens on its last display when available."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动桌面小药丸可调整它的位置。助手面板有自己的位置，重新打开时会尝试回到上次所在屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空闲时只显示图标；悬停展开，点击打开。回答生成时可停止。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Idle shows an icon; hover to expand and click to open. Stop while generating."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空闲时只显示图标；悬停展开，点击打开。回答生成时可停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "离开面板后开始倒计时；输入、悬停、生成或采集时不会收起。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starts after leaving the panel; stays open while focused, hovered, generating, or capturing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离开面板后开始倒计时；输入、悬停、生成或采集时不会收起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整页文字需要浏览器的 Apple Events 权限；在浏览器的 Developer 菜单中开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Full-page text requires browser Apple Events access. Enable it from the browser's Developer menu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整页文字需要浏览器的 Apple Events 权限；在浏览器的 Developer 菜单中开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个 Chromium 配置文件都要单独开启；未开启时仍可读网址和截图。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable it once per Chromium profile. Without it, Wisp still reads the URL and screenshot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个 Chromium 配置文件都要单独开启；未开启时仍可读网址和截图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "超出上限时保留开头和结尾，并标记省略。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Over the limit, Wisp keeps the beginning and end and marks the omission."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超出上限时保留开头和结尾，并标记省略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "排除后不截图，也不读取浏览器页面；整屏截图时也会被挖掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Excluded apps are not captured or read, and are left out of entire-screen captures."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "排除后不截图，也不读取浏览器页面；整屏截图时也会被挖掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到上限时，新建对话会询问是否移除最久未更新的一项。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At the limit, creating a conversation asks before removing the least recently updated one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "到上限时，新建对话会询问是否移除最久未更新的一项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "额外写入 last-context.json 和 last-screenshot.jpg，仅用于排查。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Writes last-context.json and last-screenshot.jpg for diagnostics only."
          }
