    "Agy 返回了空回答，没有说明原因。多半是这一轮上下文顶到了它的输入上限，或者短时间内发得太密。可以把「页面文字上限」调小一些再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agy returned an empty answer with no reason given. The most likely causes are this turn's context reaching Agy's input limit, or too many requests in quick succession. Try lowering the page-text limit and asking again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agy 返回了空回答，没有说明原因。多半是这一轮上下文顶到了 Agy 的输入上限，或者短时间内发得太密。可以把「页面文字上限」调小一些再试。"
