    "把我选中的文字翻译成中文；本来就是中文的话就翻译成英文。只给译文，不用解释。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Translate the text I selected into Chinese; if it is already Chinese, translate it into English. Give only the translation, no explanation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把我选中的文字翻译成中文；本来就是中文的话就翻译成英文。只给译文，不用解释。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "指令": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Commands"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "指令连同当前屏幕上下文一起发送，就像你亲手输入的问题。输入框里已经写了东西时，那段文字会作为材料跟在指令后面，比如先贴一段话再点「翻译」。快捷键在任何应用里都能用：先唤起面板读取当前窗口，再执行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A command is sent with the current screen context, just like a question you type. Text already in the input box follows the command as its material, so you can paste a paragraph and then click Translate. Shortcuts work in any app: Wisp opens the panel to read the current window, then runs the command."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指令连同当前屏幕上下文一起发送，就像你亲手输入的问题。输入框里已经写了东西时，那段文字会作为材料跟在指令后面，比如先贴一段话再点「翻译」。快捷键在任何应用里都能用：先唤起面板读取当前窗口，再执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
