    "整个屏幕": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entire screen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整个屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只截焦点应用最前面的窗口，旁边的窗口不会进画面。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captures only the focused app’s front window. Nothing beside it is included."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只截焦点应用最前面的窗口，旁边的窗口不会进画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截焦点窗口所在的整块屏幕，旁边的窗口也在画面里。显示器越大，每个窗口里的字越小。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captures the entire display the focused window is on, including the windows beside it. The larger the display, the smaller the text in each window."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "截焦点窗口所在的整块屏幕，旁边的窗口也在画面里。显示器越大，每个窗口里的字越小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整屏时不截的应用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps hidden from entire-screen captures"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整屏时不截的应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "勾选的应用不会出现在整屏截图里。「排除的应用」任何时候都不截，在这里显示为已勾选。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checked apps are left out of entire-screen captures. Excluded apps are never captured and appear checked here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "勾选的应用不会出现在整屏截图里。「排除的应用」任何时候都不截，在这里显示为已勾选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已在「排除的应用」里，任何时候都不截。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listed in Excluded apps, so it is never captured."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在「排除的应用」里，任何时候都不截。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」在整屏隐藏名单里，截图里没有它的窗口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is hidden from entire-screen captures, so its windows are not in the screenshot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」在整屏隐藏名单里，截图里没有它的窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
