          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Entire-screen screenshot; focus: %@]"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[整屏截图，焦点：%@]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有，覆盖整个屏幕的可视区域；「%@」是焦点应用，其他可见窗口也在图里": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "yes, covering the entire visible screen; “%@” is the focused app, and other visible windows are included"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有，覆盖整个屏幕的可视区域；「%@」是焦点应用，其他可见窗口也在图里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截图 · 整个屏幕": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screenshot · Entire screen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "截图 · 整个屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次的对话记录读不出来了，而且备份也没成功。为了不覆盖原文件，本次运行不会保存任何改动。原文件还在 Wisp 的应用支持目录里，没有被改动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your conversation history could not be read, and backing it up failed too. To avoid overwriting the original file, nothing will be saved this session. The original file is still in Wisp's Application Support folder, untouched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次的对话记录读不出来了，而且备份也没成功。为了不覆盖原文件，本次运行不会保存任何改动。原文件还在 Wisp 的应用支持目录里，没有被改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这份对话记录的格式版本号读不出来（可能来自其他版本，或被外部修改过）。为了不按旧格式覆盖它，本次运行不会保存任何改动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This conversation file's format version could not be read (it may come from another version, or was modified externally). To avoid overwriting it in the old format, nothing will be saved this session."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这份对话记录的格式版本号读不出来（可能来自其他版本，或被外部修改过）。为了不按旧格式覆盖它，本次运行不会保存任何改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对话记录文件读不出来（可能被占用、损坏，或被文件夹占了位置）。本次运行不会保存任何改动，新对话在重启后不会保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The conversation file could not be read (it may be in use, damaged, or replaced by a folder). Nothing will be saved this session, and new conversations will not survive a restart."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对话记录文件读不出来（可能被占用、损坏，或被文件夹占了位置）。本次运行不会保存任何改动，新对话在重启后不会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对话记录保存失败（磁盘空间不足或目录不可写）。本次打开期间的改动在重启后会丢失。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saving your conversation history failed (the disk may be full or the folder not writable). Changes made this session will be lost on restart."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对话记录保存失败（磁盘空间不足或目录不可写）。本次打开期间的改动在重启后会丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "服务有响应，但返回内容无法识别": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The service responded, but its reply could not be recognized."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务有响应，但返回内容无法识别"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已保存的指令读不出来，下面是默认指令。原始数据还没有被覆盖；在你点「恢复默认」之前，修改不会保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your saved commands could not be read, so the defaults are shown below. The original data has not been overwritten; changes will not be saved until you choose Restore Defaults."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存的指令读不出来，下面是默认指令。原始数据还没有被覆盖；在你点「恢复默认」之前，修改不会保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 没能存进钥匙串，这次输入没有保存下来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API key could not be saved to the Keychain; this entry was not stored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key 没能存进钥匙串，这次输入没有保存下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API Key 没能从钥匙串里删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API key could not be deleted from the Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key 没能从钥匙串里删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全部数据已删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All data has been deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部数据已删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "记录已删除，但 API Key 没能从钥匙串里全部删掉。请重启应用后再试一次清除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records were deleted, but the API keys could not all be removed from the Keychain. Restart the app and try clearing again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录已删除，但 API Key 没能从钥匙串里全部删掉。请重启应用后再试一次清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "欢迎使用 Wisp": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcome to Wisp"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 Wisp"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先连上一个模型，Wisp 才能开始回答你。所有设置只保存在这台 Mac 上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect a model first — Wisp can't answer until one is set up. Everything stays on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先连上一个模型，Wisp 才能开始回答你。所有设置只保存在这台 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已授予，Wisp 可以读取当前窗口和屏幕。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Granted — Wisp can read the current window and screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已授予，Wisp 可以读取当前窗口和屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提问时读取当前窗口和屏幕需要这个权限；纯文字提问不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reading the current window and screen with your question needs this permission; text-only questions work without it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提问时读取当前窗口和屏幕需要这个权限；纯文字提问不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在任何应用里按这个组合键呼出或收起 Wisp。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press this combination in any app to summon or hide Wisp."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何应用里按这个组合键呼出或收起 Wisp。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有可用的模型 — 完成上面任意一种连接就可以开始，也可以先跳过。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No model is available yet — finish any one connection above to start, or skip for now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有可用的模型 — 完成上面任意一种连接就可以开始，也可以先跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新运行首次设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run First-Run Setup Again"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新运行首次设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新打开首次设置向导：连接模型、录屏权限和呼出快捷键都可以在里面完成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reopen the first-run setup: connect a model, grant Screen Recording, and set the summon shortcut, all in one place."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新打开首次设置向导：连接模型、录屏权限和呼出快捷键都可以在里面完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "呼出快捷键": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summon Shortcut"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "呼出快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开完整设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Full Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开完整设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "稍后再说": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skip for Now"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稍后再说"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始使用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start Using Wisp"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "帮助": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Help"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "帮助"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "服务端在回答途中报错：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server reported an error partway through the answer: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务端在回答途中报错：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连接在回答说完之前就断开了，已收到的部分保留在上面。可以重新发送一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection closed before the answer was finished. What arrived is kept above; you can send it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接在回答说完之前就断开了，已收到的部分保留在上面。可以重新发送一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模型已达到输出上限，回答未完成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model reached its output limit. The answer is incomplete."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型已达到输出上限，回答未完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有本地文件未能删除。请处理系统错误后重试。%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some local files could not be deleted. Resolve the system error and try again. %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有本地文件未能删除。请处理系统错误后重试。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已经有 %lld 个对话，超过了上限 %lld 个。可以自己删几个，或者让它顶掉最久没用的那几个。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have %1$lld conversations, more than the limit of %2$lld. Delete a few yourself, or let the least recently used ones make room."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已经有 %1$lld 个对话，超过了上限 %2$lld 个。可以自己删几个，或者让它顶掉最久没用的那几个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删掉最旧的 %lld 个并新建": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete the %lld oldest and start a new one"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删掉最旧的 %lld 个并新建"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上限比现有的对话少，要删掉最久没更新的 %lld 个：%@。它们会被永久删除，无法撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The limit is now below the number of conversations, so the %1$lld least recently updated must go: %2$@. They will be permanently deleted and cannot be restored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上限比现有的对话少，要删掉最久没更新的 %1$lld 个：%2$@。它们会被永久删除，无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上传音频到 Soniox 过慢，字幕已停止。请检查网络后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio upload to Soniox fell behind, so captions stopped. Check your network and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上传音频到 Soniox 过慢，字幕已停止。请检查网络后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发送音频到 Soniox 失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Failed to send audio to Soniox: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送音频到 Soniox 失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "结束 Soniox 连接失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Failed to close the Soniox stream: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结束 Soniox 连接失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出后全局快捷键、字幕和小药丸都会停止。要再用，从访达或聚焦打开 Wisp。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quitting stops the global shortcuts, captions and the island. To use Wisp again, open it from Finder or Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出后全局快捷键、字幕和小药丸都会停止。要再用，从访达或聚焦打开 Wisp。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装 Ollama": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install Ollama"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装 Ollama"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可填 2,000–500,000 个字符，超出范围会自动调回。超出上限时保留开头和结尾，并标记省略。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter 2,000–500,000 characters; values outside that range are adjusted automatically. Over the limit, Wisp keeps the beginning and end and marks the omission."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可填 2,000–500,000 个字符，超出范围会自动调回。超出上限时保留开头和结尾，并标记省略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "字幕开着时不能改，先关掉字幕。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't be changed while captions are on. Turn captions off first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字幕开着时不能改，先关掉字幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soniox API Key 没能存进钥匙串，这次输入没有保存下来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Soniox API key could not be saved to the Keychain; this entry was not stored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Soniox API Key 没能存进钥匙串，这次输入没有保存下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除「%@」？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete “%@”?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除「%@」？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提问内容和它的快捷键都会被删掉，无法撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its prompt and shortcut will be deleted. This can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提问内容和它的快捷键都会被删掉，无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提问内容为空，这条指令不会出现在面板里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The prompt is empty, so this command won't appear in the panel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提问内容为空，这条指令不会出现在面板里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在回答。等它结束，或按 ⌘. 停止后再发送。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Still answering. Wait for it to finish, or press ⌘. to stop, then send."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在回答。等它结束，或按 ⌘. 停止后再发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新建对话后继续提问": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start a new conversation to keep asking"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建对话后继续提问"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发送": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连接 Soniox 超时，请检查网络后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connecting to Soniox timed out. Check your network and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接 Soniox 超时，请检查网络后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
